This package contains code written after the following works, both distributed under the Apache
License 2.0 (text in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt):

- Chorus, by Stephen Chung and Wenyu Du (DualverseAI), arXiv 2611.23386,
  https://github.com/dualverse-ai/chorus. src/chorus.py follows ChorusMemory and src/ember.py
  follows its Ember table optimiser (oe_mfree_step), both in chorus/memory_modules.py.
- Engram, by Cheng et al. (DeepSeek), arXiv 2601.07372, https://github.com/deepseek-ai/Engram.
  src/engram.py follows the module of its demo, engram_demo_v1.py.

Both are reimplementations with changes described in the module docstrings and in the paper.
